import{_ as i,o as t,c as n,a2 as o}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const m=JSON.parse('{"title":"Entry 353 | Perfect-Work Institutional Alternative Benefit: Injecting Anchor Symbiosis into Perfect World","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 353 | Perfect-Work Institutional Alternative Benefit: Injecting Anchor Symbiosis into Perfect World","no":353,"module":2,"tags":["Myriad-Realms Benchmark","Perfect World","Institutional Alternative Benefit","Anchor Symbiosis","Injection","Quantified"],"related":["29-Symbiosis-Degree Assessment System","25-Symbiotic Feedback Loop Mechanism","21-Symbiotic Network Operating Principle"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0353_模块2-完美世界-锚点共生注入完美世界.md","filePath":"en/0353_模块2-完美世界-锚点共生注入完美世界.md"}'),a={name:"en/0353_模块2-完美世界-锚点共生注入完美世界.md"};function r(s,e,l,c,d,h){return t(),n("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[o('<h1 id="entry-353-perfect-work-institutional-alternative-benefit-injecting-anchor-symbiosis-into-perfect-world" tabindex="-1">Entry 353 | Perfect-Work Institutional Alternative Benefit: Injecting Anchor Symbiosis into Perfect World <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-353-perfect-work-institutional-alternative-benefit-injecting-anchor-symbiosis-into-perfect-world" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 353 | Perfect-Work Institutional Alternative Benefit: Injecting Anchor Symbiosis into Perfect World&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 2 · Myriad-Realms Benchmark Critique Library | Series: Perfect-Work Full Decomposition (Entry 30 · Alternative Benefit) | Benchmark base: Documents 29, 25, 21</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-inject-symbiotic-institutions-into-perfect-world-—-what-happens-to-the-civilization-ledger" tabindex="-1">Introduction: Inject symbiotic institutions into Perfect World — what happens to the civilization ledger? <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-inject-symbiotic-institutions-into-perfect-world-—-what-happens-to-the-civilization-ledger" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: Inject symbiotic institutions into Perfect World — what happens to the civilization ledger?&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The previous entry simulated the collapse after Shi Hao&#39;s absence; this entry gives the positive answer: if Anchor Symbiotic institutions are injected into Perfect World, how great is the civilization-ledger benefit? This entry takes the six top-level axioms as base — anti-predation axiom, republican axiom of Myriad Races, collective ascension axiom, causal self-discipline axiom, law-first axiom (core), universal equal infinite law — to quantify institutional alternative benefit. The universal equal infinite law: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will never be eliminated; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. Infinite origin is inherent in all, so predation naturally loses its meaning. Protagonist uniqueness dependency verdict: <strong>Shi Hao = extreme-leaning-medium / single-log tendency</strong>.</p><h2 id="i-energy-level-waste-analysis-of-this-system-s-strong-ones-benefit-comparison" tabindex="-1">I. &quot;Energy-Level Waste&quot; Analysis of This System&#39;s Strong Ones (Benefit Comparison) <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-energy-level-waste-analysis-of-this-system-s-strong-ones-benefit-comparison" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. &quot;Energy-Level Waste&quot; Analysis of This System&#39;s Strong Ones (Benefit Comparison)&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Before injection: Emperor-Immortal-tier energy pressed at the front, institutional energy zero. After injection: Emperor-Immortal energy diverted to institutional construction; civilization stock continuously accumulates. Civilization stock output per unit energy rises sharply.</p><h2 id="ii-why-this-civilization-inevits-historical-regression-benefit-comparison" tabindex="-1">II. Why This Civilization Inevits Historical Regression (Benefit Comparison) <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-why-this-civilization-inevits-historical-regression-benefit-comparison" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. Why This Civilization Inevits Historical Regression (Benefit Comparison)&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Before injection: person gone, policy dies. After injection: order written into charter; Shi Hao absent and civilization does not collapse. Regression risk drops from &quot;inevitable&quot; to &quot;near zero.&quot;</p><h2 id="iii-deep-decomposition-of-the-protagonist-s-predatory-thinking-benefit-comparison" tabindex="-1">III. Deep Decomposition of the Protagonist&#39;s Predatory Thinking (Benefit Comparison) <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-deep-decomposition-of-the-protagonist-s-predatory-thinking-benefit-comparison" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. Deep Decomposition of the Protagonist&#39;s Predatory Thinking (Benefit Comparison)&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Before injection: self-seed devours stock. After injection: develop increment Origin; the stronger the strong ones, the richer Myriad Ranks; zero-sum becomes positive-sum.</p><h2 id="iv-anchor-symbiosis-alternative-this-entry-s-core-·-benefit-quantification" tabindex="-1">IV. Anchor Symbiosis Alternative (This Entry&#39;s Core · Benefit Quantification) <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-anchor-symbiosis-alternative-this-entry-s-core-·-benefit-quantification" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. Anchor Symbiosis Alternative (This Entry&#39;s Core · Benefit Quantification)&quot;">​</a></h2><table tabindex="0"><thead><tr><th>Metric</th><th>Before Injection (Single Log)</th><th>After Injection (Symbiosis)</th><th>Benefit</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Civilization Collapse Index (when absent)</td><td>Extreme</td><td>Extremely low</td><td>Sharp drop</td></tr><tr><td>Myriad-Rank Evolution Coverage</td><td>Extremely low (only human geniuses)</td><td>99%</td><td>Qualitative leap</td></tr><tr><td>Dark-Turmoil Relapse Rate</td><td>Cyclic eruption</td><td>Early intervention near zero</td><td>Sharp drop</td></tr><tr><td>Knowledge-Transmission Rate</td><td>Dies with the person</td><td>Alaya perpetual</td><td>Qualitative leap</td></tr><tr><td>Strong-One Capacity</td><td>One person alone strong</td><td>20% Activation, echelons in waves</td><td>Qualitative leap</td></tr></tbody></table><p>The benefit&#39;s essence: turning Shi Hao&#39;s one-person epic into Myriad Ranks&#39; common civilization project. Shi Hao may still be great, but his greatness no longer comes at the price of Myriad Ranks&#39; attachment.</p><h2 id="v-quest-sediment-domain-simulation-review-plan" tabindex="-1">V. Quest Sediment Domain Simulation Review Plan <a class="header-anchor" href="#v-quest-sediment-domain-simulation-review-plan" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;V. Quest Sediment Domain Simulation Review Plan&quot;">​</a></h2><ol><li>Replicate the single-log original model</li><li>Inject the full symbiotic-institution parameter set</li><li>Cross-ten-thousand-year deduction of the five metrics</li><li>Output &quot;Institutional Alternative Benefit Quantification Report&quot;</li></ol><h2 id="vi-setting-self-consistency-retcon-ending-risk-assessment" tabindex="-1">VI. Setting Self-Consistency / Retcon-Ending Risk Assessment <a class="header-anchor" href="#vi-setting-self-consistency-retcon-ending-risk-assessment" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;VI. Setting Self-Consistency / Retcon-Ending Risk Assessment&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Pre-injection self-consistency: medium-low; post-injection: high</strong></li><li><strong>Pre-injection retcon risk: high; post-injection: zero</strong></li><li><strong>Protagonist uniqueness dependency: drops from extreme-leaning-medium to extremely low</strong></li></ul><p>Add one layer: institutional alternative benefit can release cross-era because institutions are compound-interest assets. The Alaya Network, Myriad Ranks republicanism, and law framework injected by one generation automatically run in later ages, no longer requiring descendants to pay from zero. Shi-Hao-style personal epic is a depreciating asset — spent and gone; symbiotic institutions are a perpetual asset — the more used, the thicker.</p><p><strong>Old-new cosmos resource comparison</strong>: old-cosmos resources and Great Dao are finite, inevitably predatory involution; Anchor Symbiosis has everyone inherently possessing infinite origin, predation loses meaning.</p><h2 id="five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Anti-energy waste</strong>: energy diverted to civilization stock</li><li><strong>Anti-predation</strong>: zero-sum becomes positive-sum</li><li><strong>Tang-Luo upper-limit comparison</strong>: Tang Luo&#39;s alternative benefit is visible within one book; Perfect World&#39;s alternative benefit releases cross-era</li><li><strong>Myriad Races full coverage</strong>: coverage jumps from extremely low to 99%</li><li><strong>Hyper-multiverse full openness</strong>: post-injection can support multiverse expansion</li></ul><p>Add one more layer: the most undervalued item in institutional alternative benefit is confidence. When Myriad Ranks believe order does not tie to some one person, they dare to build long-horizon things. However strong Shi Hao, he cannot give this institutional confidence.</p><ul><li><strong>Universal equal infinite law</strong>: basic infinite power is inherent in all; the easygoing retain a guarantee, strivers can superimpose higher; infinite origin erases predatory motivation, predatory involution loses meaning from the root</li></ul><h2 id="supplementary-analysis-quantified-tracking-of-injection-effects" tabindex="-1">Supplementary Analysis: Quantified Tracking of Injection Effects <a class="header-anchor" href="#supplementary-analysis-quantified-tracking-of-injection-effects" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Supplementary Analysis: Quantified Tracking of Injection Effects&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The institutional alternative benefit of injecting Anchor Symbiosis into Perfect World is continuously tracked and quantified by the Alaya Network. Heng Yuan Zhou records the before/after curves of three metrics: Myriad-Rank coverage, energy utilization, SPDCI. The Anchor Symbiotic Civilization&#39;s injection into Perfect World is not tearing down and rebuilding, but grafting symbiotic institutions onto existing soil — the law-first axiom ensures the grafting process does not trigger civilizational shock. The universal equal infinite law is the first rights commitment to land during injection.</p><h2 id="supplementary-analysis-engineering-details-of-the-injection-process" tabindex="-1">Supplementary Analysis: Engineering Details of the Injection Process <a class="header-anchor" href="#supplementary-analysis-engineering-details-of-the-injection-process" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Supplementary Analysis: Engineering Details of the Injection Process&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The process of injecting Anchor Symbiosis into Perfect World is not tearing down and rebuilding, but surgical grafting. The Alaya Network first establishes a monitoring layer; Perfect World&#39;s existing institutions are preserved but accept network audit; then gradually introduce the Myriad-Ranks Republican Council, letting Perfect-Work cultivators participate in decisions; finally write the law-first axiom into that world&#39;s fundamental law. The Anchor Symbiotic Civilization&#39;s universal equal infinite law takes effect on injection day one — all beings&#39; basic evolution rights are immediately protected, no waiting for institutional completion. This &quot;rights first, institutions follow&quot; injection strategy minimizes transition pain.</p><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Institutional alternative&#39;s benefit is all-round: civilization more stable, Myriad Ranks stronger, darkness less, knowledge longer-lasting. Heng Yuan Zhou does not require Shi Hao to become another person, only requires him to share a bit of the eternity he carries with institutions — this bit buys ten thousand generations of peace.</p><p>In the final analysis, Perfect World · institutional alternative benefit of injecting Anchor Symbiosis described in this document is no isolated case — its causality and energy-level traces are filed throughout in the Alaya Network, traceable and verifiable.</p><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./350_模块2-完美世界-仙帝制度的共和化改造.html">Entry 350 · Republican Reform</a> · <a href="./352_模块2-完美世界-石昊缺位后的文明崩溃模拟.html">Entry 352 · Quest Sediment Domain Review</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/29-共生度评估体系.html">29-Symbiosis-Degree Assessment System</a></li><li>Official site: <a href="https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/</a></li></ul>',32)])])}const f=i(a,[["render",r]]);export{m as __pageData,f as default};
